_news\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/689058/mrtomatos\" data-label=\"related_btn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_very_large family_patrick-hand\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Mr.TomatoS\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzM3OTkyODMuanBn/original/366Leq.jpg\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Mr.TomatoS</h1></div><div class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\" id=\"view_game_7762194\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable Mr.TomatoS for Windows</p><div class=\"bundle_row\"><div class=\"bundle_info\"><div class=\"bundle_label\">Get this Mr.TomatoS and 1 more for $8.00 USD</div><div class=\"bundle_title\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/s/89381/mrtomatos-and-mslemons-bundle-deal\">Mr.TomatoS++ and Ms.LemonS++ bundle deal!</a></div></div><a href=\"https://itch.io/s/89381/mrtomatos-and-mslemons-bundle-deal\" class=\"button\">View bundle</a></div><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://oxtord.itch.io/mrtomatos/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzM3OTg1ODAuanBn/original/9bVgM9.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<h4>&quot;Welcome to my game, buddy!&quot;</h4>\r\n<p>Mr. TomatoS is glad to see you! He waited a long time for someone to visit him! Feel like at home and get ready for endless f̶u̶n̶  !</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzM3OTg1ODUuanBn/original/DXvH0p.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>Mr. TomatoS needs YOUR help! looks like he had not eaten for ages! Of course not, he has no hands!</p>\r\n<p>Feed Mr. Tomatos with big variety of food, combine it with blender, and use different items to help you with this task!</p>\r\n<h4>&quot;But why should I do this?&quot;</h4>\r\n<p>Glad you asked! By helping him you can earn a lot of points to spend them in the shop later! Everyone loves to earn points, right?</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzM3OTg1OTcuanBn/original/SMXtVR.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<h4>&quot;Why am i always d̶y̶i̶n̶g̶  losing?&quot;</h4>\r\n<p>Glad you asked, my dear friend! j̶u̶s̶t̶ d̶o̶n̶t̶ d̶o̶w̶n̶l̶o̶a̶d̶ i̶t̶  you need a strategy to finish the game! without a strategy, everything can go wrong.</p>\r\n<p>Manage your resources correctly to s̶t̶a̶y̶ a̶l̶i̶v̶e̶  win!)</p>\r\n<p>unless you want to make Mr. TomatoS angry.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzM3OTg2MDAuanBn/original/8WtmRa.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>This game is made in the style of old web flash games, what sets it apart from other new games!</p>\r\n<p>Feel the atmosphere of old flash games!</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzM3OTg2MDQuanBn/original/YiBaHs.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>You can complete the game only ONCE, that means that you won&#x27;t have a second chance. And how you will complete YOUR game - depends only on YOU. Try your best. Good luck.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzM3OTg2MDkuanBn/original/XrrbAA.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>Main theme by: <strong>Cnupoc (</strong><span title=\"https://freesound.org/people/Cnupoc/\"><a href=\"https://freesound.org/people/Cnupoc/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://freesound.org/people/Cnupoc/</a></span><strong>)</strong></p>\r\n<p>Game theme by: <strong>Sirkoto51 (</strong><span title=\"https://freesound.org/people/Sirkoto51/\"><a href=\"https://freesound.org/people/Sirkoto51/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://freesound.org/people/Sirkoto51/</a></span><strong>)</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Sirkoto51 soundcloud : </strong>&nbsp;<span title=\"https://soundcloud.com/sirkoto51\"><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/sirkoto51\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://soundcloud.com/sirkoto51</a></span></p>\r\n<p>Some sounds by: <strong>InspectorJ(</strong>Jonathan Shaw<strong>) (</strong><span title=\"https://freesound.org/people/InspectorJ/\"><a href=\"https://freesound.org/people/InspectorJ/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://freesound.org/people/InspectorJ/</a></span><strong>)</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>InspectorJ patreon: </strong><span title=\"https://www.patreon.com/JonathanShaw\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/JonathanShaw\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://www.patreon.com/JonathanShaw</a></span></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzM3OTkyNDAuanBn/original/fsX3bI.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<h3>MrTomatoS</h3>\r\n<p>- standard version of the game.</p>\r\n<h3>MrTomatoS++</h3>\r\n<h4>&quot; Oh oh, it looks like someone messed up the game code!&nbsp;&quot;</h4>\r\n<p>- Now you can reset your game progress after completion to get more endings</p>\r\n<p>- You can download this version even if you already played in standart version, and completed it</p>\r\n<p><br></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg width=\"12\" height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" aria-hidden><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\" id=\"game_info_panel_5737290\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"16 September 2026 @ 06:36 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 13 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"aggregate_rating\" data-tooltip=\"4.69 average rating from 757 total ratings\"><div itemprop=\"ratingValue\" content=\"4.7\" class=\"star_value\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 4.7 out of 5 stars</span><div style=\"width: 93.89696%\" class=\"star_fill\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star ic